		{
			dependencies: ["51B9A72C19F84F0E"]
			description: [
		"&f- The last three parts can also be used as overlays"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&f- An electric motor is a device that converts electrical energy into mechanical energy."
		"&f- Its working principle is based on electromagnetic induction,"
		"&f- When current passes through the coil of the motor,"
		"&f- will produce a force in the magnetic field,"
		"&f- This force causes the rotor of the motor to rotate,"
		"&f- thus driving the load operation."
		"&f- Electric motors are widely used in a variety of industrial, commercial and household appliances."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&f- The electric piston is an electrically driven reciprocating device that converts the rotary motion of the motor into linear reciprocating motion. Such devices can be used in various applications such as compressors, pneumatic actuators, robotic arms, etc."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&f- A robotic arm is a mechanical device that imitates the functions of a human arm,"
		"&f- usually consists of a series of links and joints,"
		"&f- capable of a complex range of movements,"
		"&f- Includes rotation, flexion and extension."
		"&f- The robotic arm can be programmed or remotely controlled to perform a variety of tasks,"
		"&f- Such as handling, assembly, welding, painting, measuring and exploring."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&f- The conveyor belt is a kind of transportation machinery,"
		"&f- Used to move materials or products from one location to another."
		"&f- it consists of one or more continuous ribbon structures,"
		"&f- rotates around two rollers,"
		"&f- These rollers act as drive and support points."
		"&f- The conveyor belt can run horizontally,"
		"&f- 也可以倾斜或垂直运行，"
		"&f- to suit different handling needs."
	]
